    "No implicit event-interrupt edges are added to other states.",
    "Camera captured clears takingPhoto immediately; purple exit waits for the current 6b clip.",
    "Pet release/event exits are immediate; pet self-loops still wait for clip completion.",
    "Recall chooses 4c:0.8 / 4b:0.2 when window_available is true, otherwise 4b deterministically. 4c continues to 3a."
